#: ../../../ETS2LA.UI/Pages/Settings/Assists.razor:151
msgid ""
"Adjust how ETS2LA will respond to necessary steering changes. This for "
"example controls how quickly ETS2LA will lane-change."
msgstr "調整 ETS2LA 對必要轉向調整的反應方式。例如，此設定會控制 ETS2LA 變換車道的速"
"度。"

#: ../../../ETS2LA.UI/Pages/Settings/Assists.razor:160
msgid ""
"Adjust how quickly ETS2LA will respond to desired changes in acceleration. "
"Emergency braking is not affected."
msgstr "調整 ETS2LA 對目標加速度變化的反應速度。緊急煞車不受此設定影響。"

#: ../../../ETS2LA.UI/Pages/Settings/Assists.razor:169
msgid ""
"Adjust the distance ETS2LA will try to maintain from the vehicle in front of "
"you when using Adaptive Cruise Control."
msgstr "調整使用主動式巡航控制時，ETS2LA 與前車保持的距離。"

#: ../../../ETS2LA.UI/Pages/Settings/Data.razor:71
msgid ""
"Adjust the level of detail of the game data we use. Higher values use more "
"RAM, but include more information. All levels drive the same."
msgstr "調整 ETS2LA 使用的遊戲資料詳細程度。設定越高，會占用更多記憶體，但包含的資訊"
"也更多。不論選擇哪個等級，駕駛表現都相同。"

#: ../../../ETS2LA.UI/Pages/Settings/Audio.razor:19
msgid "Adjust the volume of the audio output."
msgstr "調整音訊輸出的音量。"

